"P1864112577" "Those <color red>Hellions</color> really chap my hide.  They've gone and stolen a massive {Crate_Contents}.  Can you believe it?  They haven't moved it yet, thank goodness.  For now it's being held in an abandoned office located in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color>.  <br><br>Can you get the stuff back for me, please?  The Hellions have no business with it and it needs to get back to its rightful owner."
