// IntroString :
"P2741020074" "{Help_Me}The <color red>Skulls</color> are at it again.  They raided a warehouse and are storing the {Crate_Contents} in an abandoned office located in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color>.  I need you to get it back for me."
// SendOffString :
"P3937265852" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  I knew you wouldn't let down.  Now get that shipment.  Deliver a few Skulls to the Zig, too, if you want."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4131456801" "I sent you on assignment.  I don't understand why you're not out completing it.  Get that stolen shipment, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P390295748" "This office appears abandoned.  You know it's not, but the lobby looks that way."

