"P1632097452" "{Help_Me}This is bad.  The <color red>Trolls</color> have stolen a massive {Crate_Contents}.  They've got it sitting in an abandoned warehouse in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color>.  If they start experimenting with that stuff, things can get really bad for us - and very quickly."
// SendOffString :
"P2759787536" "Get to the Trolls and take them down before they can get into those shipments.  The last thing we need is Trolls hyper-medicated."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3221017213" "Go get that shipment.  Like, yesterday."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1914652917" "It's surprisingly quiet in this abandoned office.  Considering there are a bunch of Trolls guarding important crates inside, there's no way this is a coincidence.  <br><br>They're either waiting for you or you entered the wrong building."

