// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3215229144" "Honestly, Charlie.  Why do you talk like that?  You haven't been on Superadine for months.  Knock it off, you're getting on my nerves."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_ATTACK_DIALOG 
