"P820106489" "{Help_Me}The <color red>Trolls</color> are building up firepower and storing it underground in some caves in <color deepskyblue>Red River</color>.  We need to get dangerous objects out of the Trolls' hands.  And quickly."
// SendOffString :
"P2559294816" "Find the {Crate_Contents}, get it, and show the Trolls that handling dangerous shipments will get them hurt.  To that end, sending a few of them to the Zig via the Hospital wouldn't upset me in the least."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2360018629" "Thanks.  That should slow them down for a little while."

