// IntroString :
"P4010678127" "{Help_Me}Those greedy <color red>Circle of Thorns</color> have managed to break into a private storage facility and make off with a massive {Crate_Contents}.  They're holed up in one of their lairs in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Park</color>.  I need you to head over there and get that stuff back!"
// SendOffString :
"P3240854242" "Get the {Crate_Contents} as quick as you can, {HeroName}.  Feel free to send a few of them to the Zig, too."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1953703855" "You have no time to waste, {HeroName}.  Who knows how long they'll sit on that shipment before they start tampering with it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1149370507" "The Circle of Thorns always build their underground lairs like a maze.  You're pretty sure this one is no exception.  Let's just hope it's small."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1361354694" "Well, they're fools, of course.  The Legacy Chain has no underground base of operations.  They'll simply need to make do with park benches and soda shops. <br><br> They simply cannot compete with our firepower."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2164248618" "Agreed.  But it would be wise not to underestimate their resources."

