"P2811119016" "{Help_Me} My informant just told me that the <color red>Trolls</color> have hit a storage facility in Skyway City and returned here with a big {Crate_Contents}.  They're hiding it underground in some sewers in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Park</color> hoping no one will notice.  I noticed.  Get over there and get that shipment back, okay?"
